{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_CITY.png?t=1747414157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you try out <i>Santherya Uprising</i>, a tactical deckbuilding game with a unique card usage system. Cards don\u2019t cost mana, they cost <strong>fatigue</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cards don\u2019t have a mana cost, they cost <strong>fatigue</strong>. Playing more cards can be rewarding, but the higher their cost, the farther the character moves to the right on the <strong>fatigue bar</strong>, delaying their next turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a party of 4 characters from a group of heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the first battles of the campaign against monstrous foes and celestial soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test deckbuilding mechanics by choosing from various cards and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the first <strong>Orbs</strong> and use them to alter your characters\u2019 playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit special nodes on the map, such as the <strong>Temple</strong>, <strong>Shaman</strong>, or <strong>Witch</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This trial version offers a glimpse into the game\u2019s core mechanics and world, giving you a taste of the strategic challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1747414157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/Character_Selection.gif?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/Fight__1.gif?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/temple_new_for_gif.gif?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/fortune_teller___new_for_gif.gif?t=1747414157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/shaman_gif_new.gif?t=1747414157\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713960?t=1747414157","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713960?t=1747414157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/ba1a664aa21f1baf563c6c760e10aaecf48f2e0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747414157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/ba1a664aa21f1baf563c6c760e10aaecf48f2e0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747414157","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_CITY.png?t=1747414157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you try out <i>Santherya Uprising</i>, a tactical deckbuilding game with a unique card usage system. Cards don\u2019t cost mana, they cost <strong>fatigue</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cards don\u2019t have a mana cost, they cost <strong>fatigue</strong>. Playing more cards can be rewarding, but the higher their cost, the farther the character moves to the right on the <strong>fatigue bar</strong>, delaying their next turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a party of 4 characters from a group of heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the first battles of the campaign against monstrous foes and celestial soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test deckbuilding mechanics by choosing from various cards and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the first <strong>Orbs</strong> and use them to alter your characters\u2019 playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit special nodes on the map, such as the <strong>Temple</strong>, <strong>Shaman</strong>, or <strong>Witch</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This trial version offers a glimpse into the game\u2019s core mechanics and world, giving you a taste of the strategic challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1747414157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/Character_Selection.gif?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713960/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1747414157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor